            "question": "What is a lab-grown diamond?",
            "answer": "A lab grown diamond is a diamond that is produced in a controlled laboratory environment and advanced technological processes that replicate the natural conditions under which diamonds form in the Earth's mantle. Lab grown diamonds are chemically, physically, and optically identical to natural diamonds. They have reduced environmental and ethical concerns associated with diamond mining."
          }
