        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can you tell the difference between a lab-grown and natural diamond?",
            "answer": "Lab-grown and natural diamonds can look identical to the naked eye and cannot be reliably distinguished with standard testing tools. Trained jewellers and experts can’t also tell the difference between them. They can only be distinguished from natural diamonds using specialized equipment that can detect the specific growth patterns and inclusions characteristic of their synthetic origin"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
